{
  "schema": "signed-bank-cubic-coefficients-v1",
  "namespace": "math/reviewed-results/2026-10-23-signed-bank-cubic-coefficients-v1",
  "scope": {
    "decision": "ACCEPTED_CUBIC_DETERMINISTIC_COEFFICIENT_STAGE_WITH_SEPARATE_NEW_RANGE_COMPOSITION",
    "domain": "Odd N, d>=4, N>=6d-2, m=N-d; SAME original envelope E and coefficient space U, certified primitive Nth root q, characteristic not dividing N, exact supplied coefficient-field interface and represented list of 2N distinct scalars.",
    "result": "Construct actual monic degree-m g in U with nonzero constant, ordinary squarefreeness and full ORIGINAL axis rank using O(N^3) field additions/multiplications, O(N^2) inversions and O(N^2) live field elements.",
    "mechanism": "Generic reverse strict-gcd-chain selection uses scalar combinations in the original space, with full multiplicities and telescoping degree-drop charges for all failed trials; one separately charged optional endpoint-functional repair. Both original coprime loops, dense setup, unchanged reciprocal pencil and 2N final guard trials are included. No root/factorization/half-gcd/FFT oracle.",
    "ranges": "The original reverse-descent packet remains N>=8d-10. A separately independently accepted exact interface composition establishes N>=6d-2. No N>=6d-5 transfer: the separate endpoint-support envelope changes U and is excluded.",
    "comparison": "Improves this project's deterministic coefficient implementation from quartic arithmetic/cubic inversions to cubic arithmetic/quadratic inversions. Matches, not improves, the already available expected cubic Las Vegas stage. Generic deterministic polynomial-time scalar-span selection was already known via triangularizable matrix spaces (IKQS); bounded comparison establishes no equal/better compact cubic predecessor and no historical novelty clearance.",
    "paid_costs": "Supplied field/root/list preparation remains separate and paid, including finite quadratic coefficient-field setup O(Q^3). That coefficient field is not the genuine splitting field. Possible factorial-degree splitting extension, root recovery, amplitudes/raw weights, branch inverses, physical outputs, tests, extension/base-coordinate expansion and bit/index/read/write costs remain unchanged. Literal warm application remains cubic over the actual splitting field.",
    "limits": "No new bank-count/5N3 leading-constant improvement, efficient full compiler, FFT/end-to-end speed gain, base-field attainment, optimum, historical novelty/discovery-count promotion or owner closure. Four broader parents remain TO RESEARCH priority56. Optional endpoint envelope and unrelated candidate refinements are not included."
  },
